  /* --- still frame ---------------------------------------------------------
     The frame the loop is on at first paint, held: the second decode step,
     O PROJ lit, the multicast tree drawn across the near rows and still
     reaching for the far ones, the wavefront part way through the array,
     partial sums descending, the tail of this step's cache read landing, all
     four channel stripes mid-sweep with the channels near full and the tiles
